WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.996
Step 1. Open Patient Home. Search for the patient and select them.

1.2
00:00:04.996 --> 00:00:11.321
If Care shows Verify Patient Identity, enter the year of birth and select Verify.

2.1
00:00:11.321 --> 00:00:13.436
Step 2. Open the profile.

2.2
00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:19.404
On the patient card, select the patient's name, then View Profile in the pop-up.

2.3
00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:22.440
The page title is Patient Details.

3.1
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.522
Step 3. Read the header.

3.2
00:00:24.522 --> 00:00:31.206
It shows the patient's name, age and sex, and the patient's identifiers and tags.

4.1
00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:36.683
Step 4. Use the Actions panel. Its Patient Home button opens Patient Home,

4.2
00:00:36.683 --> 00:00:40.150
and it shows who last updated the patient.

5.1
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.769
Step 5. Read the Demography tab.

5.2
00:00:42.769 --> 00:00:48.157
The profile opens on it; General Info shows the patient's details.

6.1
00:00:48.157 --> 00:00:50.268
Step 6. Open the other tabs.

6.2
00:00:50.268 --> 00:00:54.389
Some tabs show only when you hold a permission on the patient.

6.3
00:00:54.389 --> 00:00:59.839
Clinical History opens the patient's clinical history page; select Back to Patient

6.4
00:00:59.839 --> 00:01:17.178
to return.
